content.text:
Mantap! 🎉 Sekarang lanjut ke **Dashboard Guru**.

Dashboard guru akan punya fitur:
- Monitor aktivitas siswa realtime
- Lihat daftar siswa & nilai
- Kelola materi & kuis
- Lihat sebagai siswa (impersonation)

Mulai dari **Step 1 — Update Firestore Rules** dulu, tambahkan akses guru:

Buka Firebase Console → **Firestore** → **Rules** → replace seluruhnya:

```
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {

    function isGuru() {
      return request.auth != null &&
        get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.role == 'guru';
    }

    function isSiswa() {
      return request.auth != null &&
        get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.role == 'siswa';
    }

    match /users/{userId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId;
    }

    match /bab/{babId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if isGuru();

      match /kuis/{soalId} {
        allow read: if request.auth != null;
        allow write: if isGuru();
      }
    }

    match /kuis/{kuisId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if isGuru();
    }

    match /hasil_kuis/{hasilId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if request.auth != null;
    }
  }
}
```

Klik **Publish**.

